    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwearigania ase okoagacha Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(1 Abar 5:1-8)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sulemani akaroberia koagachera erieta ri’Omonene Hekalu, naende eagachere enyomba yaye y’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio akabeeka abanto chilifu emerongo etano na ebere (70,000) bakaba bakobogoria chigurube, na abanto chilifu emerongo etano na etato (80,000) bakaba bakobaacha amagena agwo ase ebitunwa, na abanto chilifu isato na amagana atano na rimo (3,600) bakaba abateneneri b’abaanto abwo bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Sulemani agatoma amang’ana ase Huramu, omorwoti o Turo, akamoteebia, “Buna kwarenge gokorera Daudi tata, kware komotomera emete y’emecharake na ere akeagachera enyomba amenyete ime, inkorere nainche boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, inche nabeire ang’e koagachera erieta ri’Omonene, Nyasae one, enyomba. Na enyomba eye nigo ndayiatanane na koyechena ase Omonene, erinde tonyare gosambera ubani ere nogotioka okuya asare, na kobeeka emegati ebe ekoruegwa ase Nyasae kogenderera botambe. Boigo tobe tokorua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa bia mambia na ebia mogoroba, na ebie Chisabato na ebi’Emetienyi Emeyia, na ebi’Amatuko Amanene ay’Omonene, Nyasae oito. Ebing’wanso ebio nigo biachikeretwe Abaisraeli babe bakobirua botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba inche ngochia koagacha nigo erabe enene mono, ekiagera Nyasae nomonene goetania chinyasae chinde chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ning’o oranyare komoagachera enyomba? Rora igoro na igoro aare mono tekomoisana amenyeo. Inche inki ing’isaine ng’a imoagachere enyomba, otatiga imoagachere aase ubani egosamberwa oka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bono, ntomere omonto omong’aini omanyete mono gokora emeremo ase chitaabu, chifeta, chitaai, n’echichuma, na koroisia ebitambaa bire nebieni bimonyinga, na ebibariri, na ebire buru, naende akore emeremo y’okomang’a. Ere abe ogokora emeremo amo nabakori b’emeremo eyio baria bare amo nainche aiga ase ense ya Yuda, na ase Yerusalemu, abwo Daudi tata abegete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende ntomere emecharake, na emetarakwa, na emete ekorokwa alugumu korwa Lebanoni, ekiagera nimanyete ng’a abasomba bao mbamanyete kogecha emete agwo Lebanoni. Na abasomba baane mbabe bagokora emeremo amo nabao,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ase okondoiseria chibao chinyinge, ekiagera enyomba ngochia koagacha nigo erabe enene mono, naende ey’ogokumia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning’ee abasomba bao endagera, baria bagotema emete na gotandora chibao. Nimbae engano esenyentire chitani chilifu ibere (2,000), na esairi chitani amagana abere (200), na edivai chilita chilifu amagana ane (400,000), na amaguta chilita chilifu amagana ane (400,000).”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huramu, omorwoti o Turo, akairaneria ase riruube atomete ase Sulemani, rigoteeba: “Ekiagera Omonene anchete abanto baye, okobekire aye koba omorwoti igoro ase bare,”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Huramu akarika: “Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, atogigwe, oria okorete igoro na ense, oria oeire Daudi omorwoti omwana ore nobong’aini, obomanyi na okorengereria okuya omanyete gochora ayare amaya, oyio oraagachere Omonene Hekalu, naende eagachere enyomba y’oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono natomire asore Huramu‐Abi, omooroisia omong’aini ore nokomanya okonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’ina nigo arenge omokungu bw’egesaku gia Dani, na ise nigo arenge omonto o Turo. Ere nigo orokereretigwe akamanya buya gokora emeremo ase chitaabu, ne chifeta, ne chitaai, na ebioma, na amagena, ne chibao. Naende nigo amanyete koroisia ebitambaa bi’ebieni bimonyinga, na ebire buru, na ebibariri amo nebi’egatani engiya. Ere nigo amanyete emeremo ende yonsi y’okomang’a na gokora omogwekano onde bwonsi are goteebigwa ng’a ayokore. Tiga akore emeremo amo nabakori emeremo bao, na amo nabwo omonene one Daudi iso abegete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio bono totomere intwe, abasomba bao, engano, na esairi, na amaguta, na edivai, ebinto biria aye, omonene one, gwateebete ng’a nototomere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio intwe natoteme emete ende yonsi oganetie korwa Lebanoni na toyetome gocha asore eboire amo, erentwe asore nenyancha, ebe echeng’enenete goika Yopa, na korwa aroro oyioyie oyeire Yerusalemu aye omonyene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oboagacho bwe Hekalu bogochakwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(1 Abar 6:1-8)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Sulemani akabara na korika abasacha abamenyi bonsi barenge ase ense y’Abaisraeli buna Daudi ise akorete, akanyora ng’a nigo barenge abanto chilifu rigana erimo na emerongo etano na isato, na amagana atano na rimo (153,600).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabeka abanto chilifu emerongo etano na ebere (70,000) bakaba bakobogoria chigurube, ne chilifu emerongo etano na etato (80,000) bakaba bakobaacha amagena ase ebitunwa, ne chilifu isato, na amagana atano na rimo (3,600) bakaba bagotebereria abanto bakore emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
